### Listar todos os subjects
GET http://localhost:8000/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

### Listar com busca
GET http://localhost:8000/api/subjects?search=math&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### Listar por departamento
GET http://localhost:8000/api/subjects?department=CS
Content-Type: application/json

### Criar novo subject (exemplo)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Calculus I",
  "code": "MATH101",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "description": "Introduction to calculus"
}

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/
Content-Type: application/json

